    "## Maths to generate a sine wave \n",
    "\n",
    "The equation of a sine wave is:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$ \n",
    "y(t)= A\\sin(\\omega t + \\phi)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "where:\n",
    "- $A$ is the amplitude (unit of the physical system we simulate)\n",
    "- $\\omega$ is the angular frequency (rad/s)\n",
    "- $\\phi$ is the phase (rad)\n",
    "\n",
    "$ : It is latex language to write maths in a nice way "
